{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013-r1\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a107a2-e9e4-7670-bc44-1144fa9b27e2\", \"kind\": \"quality\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"694e69799119300513e724ef3a288e2da9fde41d\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-001991\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-0.txt\": \"438b7ebe196cd82618de94b7ca4974b27c8cc98c023f3da6b55e68d27569e6d4\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-1.txt\": \"594cc4c9e6c6ec4b0d224f5578a73ec4f333153de7fff5c80c4004442c6d6de2\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-2.txt\": \"99fcc821adc9c2f3fc020fbe3a1e0603d31c6444fc37b8e8dfb4656e3bd8ff4d\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-3.txt\": \"d4d79d40aa14ae04da4fc42956162b083ada0aea87e626c633576faeeae537e5\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-4.txt\": \"500149ecfe834ea9b68ab21b4b20abb34cd8c9b7576ad563a4bb4561a1bad21e\"}}, \"claims\": [\"Explicit restored preparation routes the original builder to the original readonly preflight CLI without requiring a historical signed receipt.\", \"Incomplete, mixed, relative-path or FULL restored inputs fail closed without historical fallback.\", \"Restored reports retain exact installation, current API physical database, signed root and credential-generation checks.\", \"This code change leaves live services and Host disabled and does not prove eight workbenches restored.\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-0.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Production wiring shared by Registry and the M2-B control plane.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport os\\nimport json\\nimport subprocess\\nimport sys\\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom typing import Any\\n\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.control_protocols import (\\n    CompositionControl,\\n    InstallationControl,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.manifest_loader import ManifestLoader\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.registry_service import RegistryService\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.registry_store import PostgresRegistryStore\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.signature import (\\n    TRUST_ROOTS_ENV,\\n    FileTrustRootProvider,\\n    TrustRoot,\\n    TrustRootConfigurationError,\\n    TrustRootProvider,\\n)\\n\\n_REPOSITORY_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[4]\\nRegistryStoreFactory = Callable[[], Any]\\nManifestLoaderFactory = Callable[..., Any]\\n\\n\\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\\nclass RuntimeControlPlane:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Process-owned control services; construction starts no runtime work.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    installation_store: Any\\n    installation_reader: Any\\n    revalidator: Any\\n    lifecycle_service: Any\\n    configuration_service: Any\\n    configuration_authorize: Any\\n    disable_service: Any = None\\n    view_reader: Any = None\\n    disable_dependent: Any = None\\n    live_job_directory: Any = None\\n    pipeline_control_factory: Any = None\\n    first_dispatch_registration_service: Any = None\\n    ecommerce_growth_cutover_service: Any = None\\n    ecommerce_growth_cutover_control: Any = None\\n    workshop_catalog: Any = None\\n\\n\\nclass _LazyRuntimeWorkshopCatalog:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Read-only catalog dependencies are resolved only when requested.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self, *, view_reader):\\n        self._view_reader = view_reader\\n        self._catalog = None\\n\\n    def resolve_catalog(self):\\n        if self._catalog is None:\\n            from aos_api.asset_registry.workshop_catalog_source import PostgresWorkshopCatalogSource\\n            from aos_api.ecommerce_runtime_workshop_catalog import RuntimeWorkshopCatalog\\n\\n            self._catalog = RuntimeWorkshopCatalog(\\n                source=PostgresWorkshopCatalogSource(),\\n                loader=ManifestLoader(\\n                    _allowlist_roots(repository_root=_REPOSITORY_ROOT),\\n                    trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots(),\\n                ),\\n                view_reader=self._view_reader,\\n            )\\n        return self._catalog\\n\\n    def list_modules(self, **kwargs):\\n        return self.resolve_catalog().list_modules(**kwargs)\\n\\n\\ndef build_runtime_workshop_catalog_reader(*, view_reader):\\n    return _LazyRuntimeWorkshopCatalog(view_reader=view_reader)\\n\\n\\nclass _LazyRuntimeViewReader:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Resolve the read projection on first request, not during app import.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\\n        self._reader: Any = None\\n\\n    def _resolve(self) -> Any:\\n        if self._reader is None:\\n            from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_view import RuntimeViewReader, read_current_legacy_content_route\\n\\n            self._reader = RuntimeViewReader(\\n                installation_reader=_build_read_only_installation_service(),\\n                ui_session_resolver=_build_runtime_ui_session_resolver(),\\n                legacy_content_route_reader=read_current_legacy_content_route,\\n            )\\n        return self._reader\\n\\n    def get_installation(self, **kwargs: Any) -> Any:\\n        return self._resolve().get_installation(**kwargs)\\n\\n    def list_configurations(self, **kwargs: Any) -> Any:\\n        return self._resolve().list_configurations(**kwargs)\\n\\n    def list_configuration_sources(self, **kwargs: Any) -> Any:\\n        return self._resolve().list_configuration_sources(**kwargs)\\n\\n    def get_operation(self, **kwargs: Any) -> Any:\\n        return self._resolve().get_operation(**kwargs)\\n\\n\\ndef _current_a0v_host_preflight(*, signed_receipt: str, credential_reference: str,\\n                                preparation_only: bool = False) -> bool:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Bind this API process to the current signed A0-V database before Host selection.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if not Path(credential_reference).is_absolute():\\n        return False\\n    try:\\n        restored_fields = ('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE',\\n                           'AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID')\\n        restored_route = any(name in os.environ for name in restored_fields)\\n        command = [sys.executable, str(_REPOSITORY_ROOT / \\\"scripts/a0v_current_runtime_host_preflight.py\\\"),\\n                   \\\"--credential-file\\\", credential_reference]\\n        if restored_route:\\n            identity_reference, installation_id = (\\n                os.getenv(name, '').strip() for name in restored_fields)\\n            root = os.getenv('AOS_BUNDLE_ROOT', '').strip()\\n            trust = os.getenv('AOS_BUNDLE_TRUST_ROOTS_FILE', '').strip()\\n            if (preparation_only is not True or signed_receipt or not installation_id\\n                    or any(not Path(path).is_absolute()\\n                           for path in (identity_reference, root, trust))):\\n                return False\\n            command.extend(['--restored-api-identity', identity_reference,\\n                '--restored-installation', installation_id, '--bundle-root', root,\\n                '--trust-roots-file', trust])\\n        else:\\n            if not Path(signed_receipt).is_absolute():\\n                return False\\n            command.extend(['--signed-receipt', signed_receipt])\\n        if preparation_only:\\n            command.append(\\\"--preparation-only\\\")\\n        result = subprocess.run(\\n            command,\\n            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60, check=False,\\n            env={**os.environ, \\\"AOS_DOTENV_DISABLED\\\": \\\"1\\\"},\\n        )\\n        if result.returncode != 0:\\n            return False\\n        report = json.loads(result.stdout.splitlines()[-1])\\n        if (report.get(\\\"outcome\\\") != \\\"CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_READONLY_PREFLIGHT_GREEN\\\"\\n                or report.get(\\\"authorization\\\") != \\\"PREFLIGHT_ONLY_NO_RUNTIME_START\\\"\\n                or report.get(\\\"scope\\\") != [\\\"org-org\\\", \\\"dev-project\\\"]\\n                or report.get(\\\"admissionMode\\\", \\\"FULL\\\")\\n                    != (\\\"PREPARATION_ONLY\\\" if preparation_only else \\\"FULL\\\")):\\n            return False\\n        if restored_route and (report.get('installationId') != installation_id\\n                               or report.get('database') != 'aos_meta_head'):\\n            return False\\n        authority = report.get(\\\"databaseAuthority\\\")\\n        if (type(authority) is not list or len(authority) != 3\\n                or type(authority[0]) is not str or type(authority[1]) is not int\\n                or type(authority[2]) is not str):\\n            return False\\n        if restored_route and authority[2] != 'aos_meta_head':\\n            return False\\n        if (Path(os.environ[\\\"AOS_BUNDLE_ROOT\\\"]).resolve(strict=True)\\n                != Path(report[\\\"signedRoot\\\"]).resolve(strict=True)\\n                or Path(os.environ[\\\"AOS_BUNDLE_TRUST_ROOTS_FILE\\\"]).resolve(strict=True)\\n                != Path(report[\\\"trustRoots\\\"]).resolve(strict=True)):\\n            return False\\n        import psycopg\\n        from psycopg.rows import dict_row\\n        from aos_api.db import get_dsn\\n        with psycopg.connect(get_dsn(), row_factory=dict_row) as conn:\\n            conn.read_only = True\\n            row = conn.execute(\\n                \\\"\\\"\\\"SELECT coalesce(inet_server_addr()::text,'local') AS server_addr,\\n                          inet_server_port() AS server_port,current_database() AS database_name\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n            ).fetchone()\\n        if [row[\\\"server_addr\\\"], row[\\\"server_port\\\"] or 0, row[\\\"database_name\\\"]] != authority:\\n            return False\\n        from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_connections import pin_runtime_file_generation\\n        pin_runtime_file_generation(credential_reference, report.get(\\\"credentialFileGeneration\\\"))\\n        from aos_api.aip_responsibility_template_authority import pin_verified_signed_release_root\\n        pin_verified_signed_release_root(Path(report[\\\"signedRoot\\\"]))\\n        return True\\n    except Exception:\\n        return False\\n\\n\\ndef build_production_runtime_host_selection(*, control_plane: RuntimeControlPlane):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build but do not start the explicitly enabled persistent runtime host.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.control_policy import (\\n        APPLY_INSTALLATION_OPERATION,\\n        DISABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION,\\n        ENABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION,\\n        VERIFY_INSTALLATION_OPERATION,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.current_permission import CurrentControlPermission\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.generation_attempts import GenerationDrainReader\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.oci_driver import CleanupOnlyOciDriver, OciDriver\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.production_preparation import (\\n        ProductionPreparationDependencies,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.production_runtime import (\\n        RuntimeWorkerDependencies,\\n        select_production_runtime_host,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.release_revalidation import RuntimeReleaseRevalidator\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_connections import (\\n        runtime_directory_connection,\\n        runtime_web_identity_connection,\\n        runtime_worker_connection,\\n    )\\n\\n    enabled = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_HOST_ENABLED\\\", \\\"\\\").strip() == \\\"1\\\"\\n    runtime_dsn = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_DATABASE_URL\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n    directory_dsn = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_DIRECTORY_DATABASE_URL\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n    credential_reference = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_CREDENTIAL_FILE\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n    oci_context = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_OCI_CONTEXT\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n    runtime_platform = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_PLATFORM\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n    admission_flag = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_PREPARATION_ONLY\\\", \\\"0\\\").strip()\\n    if enabled and admission_flag not in {\\\"0\\\", \\\"1\\\"}:\\n        from aos_api.extension_runtime.production_runtime import RuntimeHostSelection\\n        return RuntimeHostSelection(None, \\\"INACTIVE\\\", \\\"INVALID_ADMISSION_MODE\\\")\\n    preparation_only = enabled and admission_flag == \\\"1\\\"\\n    if enabled:\\n        signed_receipt = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_CURRENT_SIGNED_RECEIPT\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n        restored_route = any(name in os.environ for name in (\\n            'AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE', 'AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID'))\\n        if not credential_reference or (not signed_receipt and not restored_route):\\n            from aos_api.extension_runtime.production_runtime import RuntimeHostSelection\\n            return RuntimeHostSelection(None, \\\"INACTIVE\\\", \\\"CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_PREFLIGHT_REQUIRED\\\")\\n        if not _current_a0v_host_preflight(\\n            signed_receipt=signed_receipt, credential_reference=credential_reference,\\n            preparation_only=preparation_only,\\n        ):\\n            from aos_api.extension_runtime.production_runtime import RuntimeHostSelection\\n            return RuntimeHostSelection(None, \\\"INACTIVE\\\", \\\"CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_PREFLIGHT_FAILED\\\")\\n    dependencies = None\\n    if (\\n        enabled\\n        and type(control_plane) is RuntimeControlPlane\\n        and (credential_reference or (runtime_dsn and directory_dsn))\\n        and oci_context\\n        and runtime_platform\\n    ):\\n        try:\\n            trust_roots = _configured_trust_roots()\\n            policy = ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=trust_roots)\\n            loader = ManifestLoader(\\n                _allowlist_roots(repository_root=_REPOSITORY_ROOT),\\n                trust_roots=trust_roots,\\n            )\\n            driver = OciDriver(context=oci_context)\\n            preparation = ProductionPreparationDependencies(\\n                connect=runtime_worker_connection,\\n                installation_store=control_plane.installation_store,\\n                revalidator=RuntimeReleaseRevalidator(release_policy=policy),\\n                policy=policy,\\n                loader=loader,\\n                apply_permission=CurrentControlPermission(\\n                    operation=APPLY_INSTALLATION_OPERATION\\n                ),\\n                verification_permission=CurrentControlPermission(\\n                    operation=VERIFY_INSTALLATION_OPERATION\\n                ),\\n                enable_permission=CurrentControlPermission(\\n                    operation=ENABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION\\n                ),\\n                configuration_authorize=control_plane.configuration_authorize,\\n                driver=driver,\\n                platform=runtime_platform,\\n                live_directory=control_plane.live_job_directory,\\n            )\\n            ui_catalog=None\\n            ui_markings=()\\n            if not preparation_only and os.getenv('AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_UI_READ_ENABLED','').strip()=='1':\\n                from aos_api.asset_registry.workshop_catalog_source import PostgresWorkshopCatalogSource\\n                from aos_api.ecommerce_runtime_workshop_catalog import RuntimeWorkshopCatalog\\n                if not callable(getattr(control_plane.view_reader,'get_installation',None)):\\n                    raise ValueError('current runtime UI view reader required')\\n                raw_markings=json.loads(os.getenv('AOS_EXTENSION_UI_READ_MARKINGS_JSON','[]'))\\n                if type(raw_markings) is not list:raise ValueError('UI markings must be a JSON list')\\n                ui_markings=tuple(raw_markings)\\n                ui_catalog=RuntimeWorkshopCatalog(source=PostgresWorkshopCatalogSource(),loader=loader,\\n                                                   view_reader=control_plane.view_reader)\\n            stage_flag = os.getenv('AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_CONFIGURATION_STAGE_ENABLED','0').strip()\\n            if stage_flag not in {'0','1'}:\\n                raise ValueError('exact configuration staging flag required')\\n            dependencies = RuntimeWorkerDependencies(\\n                installation_store=control_plane.installation_store,\\n                configuration_authorize=control_plane.configuration_authorize,\\n                disable_permission=CurrentControlPermission(\\n                    operation=DISABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION\\n                ),\\n                drain_reader=GenerationDrainReader(),\\n                cleanup_driver=CleanupOnlyOciDriver(driver),\\n                disable_dependent=control_plane.disable_dependent,\\n                preparation=preparation,\\n                ui_read_catalog=ui_catalog,\\n                ui_read_markings=ui_markings,\\n                configuration_stage_enabled=stage_flag == '1' and not preparation_only,\\n            )\\n        except (TypeError, ValueError):\\n            dependencies = None\\n    return select_production_runtime_host(\\n        enabled=enabled,\\n        preparation_only=preparation_only,\\n        directory_connect=runtime_directory_connection,\\n        runtime_connect=runtime_worker_connection,\\n        web_connect=runtime_web_identity_connection,\\n        dependencies=dependencies,\\n    )\\n\\n\\nclass _UnavailableTrustRootProvider:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Deferred fail-closed provider that keeps read-only Registry APIs alive.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self, error: Exception) -> None:\\n        self._error = error\\n\\n    def get_trust_root(self, *, publisher: str, key_id: str) -> TrustRoot | None:\\n        raise TrustRootConfigurationError(\\n            \\\"trust-root configuration is unavailable\\\"\\n        ) from self._error\\n\\n\\ndef build_asset_registry_service(\\n    *,\\n    repository_root: Path = _REPOSITORY_ROOT,\\n    registry_store_factory: RegistryStoreFactory = PostgresRegistryStore,\\n    manifest_loader_factory: ManifestLoaderFactory = ManifestLoader,\\n) -> RegistryService:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build the canonical Registry service from server-controlled roots.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    trust_roots = _configured_trust_roots()\\n    loader = manifest_loader_factory(\\n        _allowlist_roots(repository_root=repository_root),\\n        trust_roots=trust_roots,\\n    )\\n    return RegistryService(\\n        store=registry_store_factory(),\\n        loader=loader,\\n        trust_roots=trust_roots,\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef build_composition_service() -> CompositionControl:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Lazily assemble the M2-B Composition service after B1 is installed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.composition_service import CompositionService\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.composition_store import PostgresCompositionStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_store import PostgresInstallationStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.registry_snapshot import RegistrySnapshotReader\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n\\n    installation_store = PostgresInstallationStore()\\n    return CompositionService(\\n        snapshot_reader=RegistrySnapshotReader(\\n            release_policy=ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots())\\n        ),\\n        composition_store=PostgresCompositionStore(),\\n        command_store=installation_store,\\n        baseline_reader=installation_store,\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef _configured_uninstall_command_store():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Opt in only with a protected command identity reference; validate on use.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.uninstall_command_connection import (\\n        CREDENTIAL_FILE, connect_uninstall_command,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_store import PostgresInstallationStore\\n\\n    if not os.getenv(CREDENTIAL_FILE, \\\"\\\").strip():\\n        return None\\n    return PostgresInstallationStore(connect_factory=connect_uninstall_command)\\n\\n\\ndef build_installation_service() -> InstallationControl:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Lazily assemble the M2-B Installation service after B1 is installed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.composition_store import PostgresCompositionStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_revalidation import (\\n        InstallationRevalidator,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_service import InstallationService\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_store import PostgresInstallationStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_uninstall import RuntimeUninstallGuard\\n\\n    command_store = _configured_uninstall_command_store()\\n    return InstallationService(\\n        store=PostgresInstallationStore(),\\n        composition_store=PostgresCompositionStore(),\\n        revalidator=InstallationRevalidator(\\n            release_policy=ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots())\\n        ),\\n        runtime_uninstall_guard=RuntimeUninstallGuard(),\\n        **({\\\"uninstall_command_store\\\": command_store} if command_store is not None else {}),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef _build_read_only_installation_service() -> InstallationControl:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build the Installation projection with an actually read-only connection.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.composition_store import PostgresCompositionStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_revalidation import InstallationRevalidator\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_service import InstallationService\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_store import PostgresInstallationStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n    from aos_api.db import connect_read_only\\n\\n    return InstallationService(\\n        store=PostgresInstallationStore(connect_factory=connect_read_only),\\n        composition_store=PostgresCompositionStore(),\\n        revalidator=InstallationRevalidator(\\n            release_policy=ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots())\\n        ),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef _build_runtime_ui_session_resolver():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build the fail-closed signed frontend projection from server-owned inputs.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    from aos_api.db import connect_read_only\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.ui_resources import ProductionUiSessionResolver\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n\\n    loader = ManifestLoader(\\n        _allowlist_roots(repository_root=_REPOSITORY_ROOT),\\n        trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots(),\\n    )\\n    return ProductionUiSessionResolver(\\n        connect_factory=connect_read_only,\\n        release_policy=ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots()),\\n        loader=loader,\\n        resource_origin=os.getenv(\\\"AOS_EXTENSION_UI_RESOURCE_ORIGIN\\\"),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef build_runtime_ui_resource_reader():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Read published static frontend code without inheriting tenant scope.\\n\\n    ``asset_bundle*`` carries no tenant RLS, so the reader opens a read-only\\n    connection that still authenticates as the runtime role. Passing only\\n    ``inherit_scope=False`` would skip SET ROLE entirely and a NOINHERIT login\\n    would be denied on the release snapshot query.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    from aos_api.db import connect_read_only\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.ui_resource_reader import PublishedUiResourceReader\\n\\n    roots = _configured_trust_roots()\\n    return PublishedUiResourceReader(\\n        connect_factory=lambda: connect_read_only(inherit_scope=False, platform_role=True),\\n        release_policy=ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=roots),\\n        loader=ManifestLoader(_allowlist_roots(repository_root=_REPOSITORY_ROOT), trust_roots=roots),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef build_runtime_lifecycle_service():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Wire preparation commands, without exposing routes or starting workers.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return build_runtime_control_plane().lifecycle_service\\n\\n\\ndef build_runtime_view_reader():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build the read-only runtime projection without enabling command services.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return _LazyRuntimeViewReader()\\n\\n\\ndef build_runtime_control_plane(*, disable_dependent: Any = None, registration_connect: Any = None) -> RuntimeControlPlane:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Assemble current runtime controls without connecting or starting workers.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    from aos_api.aip_runtime_configuration_sources import (\\n        build_current_configuration_authorization,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.composition_store import PostgresCompositionStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_revalidation import (\\n        InstallationRevalidator,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_service import InstallationService\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.installation_store import PostgresInstallationStore\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.release_policy import ReleasePolicy\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.configuration_service import (\\n        RuntimeConfigurationService,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.configuration_authorization import (\\n        CurrentConfigurationPermission,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.lifecycle_service import RuntimeLifecycleService\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.disable_service import RuntimeDisableService\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.current_permission import CurrentControlPermission\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_view import RuntimeViewReader, read_current_legacy_content_route\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.control_policy import DISABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.release_revalidation import (\\n        RuntimeReleaseRevalidator,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_uninstall import RuntimeUninstallGuard\\n    from aos_api.extension_runtime.live_job_directory import LivePreparedJobDirectory\\n    from aos_api.pipeline_control_service import PipelineControlServiceFactory\\n\\n    store = PostgresInstallationStore()\\n    command_store = _configured_uninstall_command_store()\\n    policy = ReleasePolicy(trust_roots=_configured_trust_roots())\\n    planning = RuntimeReleaseRevalidator(release_policy=policy)\\n    installation = InstallationService(\\n        store=store,\\n        composition_store=PostgresCompositionStore(),\\n        revalidator=InstallationRevalidator(release_policy=policy),\\n        planning_revalidator=planning,\\n        runtime_uninstall_guard=RuntimeUninstallGuard(),\\n        **({\\\"uninstall_command_store\\\": command_store} if command_store is not None else {}),\\n    )\\n\\n    # A control plane that owns ecommerce registration must also own the\\n    # matching disable lifecycle.  Keep the generic plane domain-neutral, and\\n    # preserve an explicitly supplied dependent for tests or another host.\\n    if registration_connect is not None and disable_dependent is None:\\n        from aos_api.ecommerce_growth_lifecycle import EcommerceGrowthDisableDependent\\n\\n        disable_dependent = EcommerceGrowthDisableDependent()\\n\\n    disable = RuntimeDisableService(\\n        installation_store=store,\\n        installation_reader=installation,\\n        check_current_permission=CurrentControlPermission(\\n            operation=DISABLE_RUNTIME_OPERATION\\n        ),\\n        dependent=disable_dependent,\\n    )\\n    authorize = build_current_configuration_authorization(\\n        permission=CurrentConfigurationPermission(installation_store=store)\\n    )\\n    lifecycle = RuntimeLifecycleService(\\n        installation_store=store,\\n        installation_reader=installation,\\n        revalidator=planning,\\n    )\\n    configuration = RuntimeConfigurationService(\\n        installation_store=store,\\n        installation_reader=installation,\\n        revalidator=planning,\\n        authorize=authorize,\\n    )\\n    registration = None\\n    cutover = None\\n    cutover_control = None\\n    if registration_connect is not None:\\n        from aos_api.ecommerce_growth_registration import FirstDispatchRegistrationService\\n        registration = FirstDispatchRegistrationService(\\n            connect=registration_connect, installation_store=store,\\n            configuration_authorize=authorize, release_policy=policy,\\n        )\\n        from aos_api.ecommerce_growth_cutover import EcommerceGrowthCutoverStore\\n        from aos_api.ecommerce_growth_cutover_connection import scoped_cutover_connection\\n        cutover = EcommerceGrowthCutoverStore(\\n            scoped_cutover_connection(registration_connect), registration_service=registration,\\n        )\\n        from aos_api.ecommerce_growth_cutover_control import EcommerceGrowthCutoverControl\\n        cutover_control = EcommerceGrowthCutoverControl(cutover)\\n    view_reader = RuntimeViewReader(\\n        installation_reader=_build_read_only_installation_service(),\\n        ui_session_resolver=_build_runtime_ui_session_resolver(),\\n        legacy_content_route_reader=read_current_legacy_content_route,\\n    )\\n    return RuntimeControlPlane(\\n        workshop_catalog=build_runtime_workshop_catalog_reader(view_reader=view_reader),\\n        first_dispatch_registration_service=registration,\\n        ecommerce_growth_cutover_service=cutover,\\n        ecommerce_growth_cutover_control=cutover_control,\\n        installation_store=store,\\n        installation_reader=installation,\\n        revalidator=planning,\\n        lifecycle_service=lifecycle,\\n        configuration_service=configuration,\\n        disable_service=disable,\\n        view_reader=view_reader,\\n        configuration_authorize=authorize,\\n        disable_dependent=disable_dependent,\\n        live_job_directory=LivePreparedJobDirectory(),\\n        pipeline_control_factory=PipelineControlServiceFactory(\\n            event_dispatch_connect=registration_connect,\\n            installation_store=store,\\n            policy=policy,\\n            allowlist_roots=_allowlist_roots(repository_root=_REPOSITORY_ROOT),\\n        ),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef build_integration_case_service():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Assemble the M4 Integration Case service from PostgreSQL truth sources.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.integration_projection import (\\n        IntegrationExpiryProjector,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.integration_reader import (\\n        PostgresIntegrationCaseReader,\\n        PrincipalMarkingResolver,\\n    )\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.integration_service import IntegrationCaseService\\n    from aos_api.asset_registry.integration_store import PostgresIntegrationStore\\n\\n    return IntegrationCaseService(\\n        store=PostgresIntegrationStore(),\\n        reader=PostgresIntegrationCaseReader(),\\n        marking_resolver=PrincipalMarkingResolver(),\\n        expiry_projector=IntegrationExpiryProjector(),\\n    )\\n\\n\\ndef _allowlist_roots(*, repository_root: Path) -> dict[str, Path]:\\n    roots: dict[str, Path] = {}\\n    catalog_root = repository_root / \\\"bundles\\\"\\n    if catalog_root.is_dir():\\n        roots[\\\"catalog\\\"] = catalog_root\\n    configured_root = os.getenv(\\\"AOS_BUNDLE_ROOT\\\")\\n    if configured_root:\\n        server_root = Path(configured_root)\\n        roots[\\\"server\\\"] = server_root\\n        # Canonical ecommerce releases created by the first-install executor\\n        # persist this alias in their immutable artifact references.\\n        roots[\\\"a0v-canonical\\\"] = server_root\\n        # Current isolated releases carry this immutable alias. Signature and\\n        # trust-root verification still apply to every loaded bundle.\\n        roots[\\\"a0v-current\\\"] = server_root\\n        # Restored Qiyuehui releases persist this alias in Registry as well.\\n        # It uses the same configured root and existing signature verification.\\n        roots[\\\"a0v-qyh-current\\\"] = server_root\\n    return roots\\n\\n\\ndef _configured_trust_roots() -> TrustRootProvider | None:\\n    if not os.getenv(TRUST_ROOTS_ENV):\\n        return None\\n    try:\\n        return FileTrustRootProvider.from_environment()\\n    except (TrustRootConfigurationError, TypeError, ValueError) as exc:\\n        return _UnavailableTrustRootProvider(exc)\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-1.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Routing and fail-closed checks only; fixtures grant no runtime authority.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport json\\nfrom types import SimpleNamespace\\n\\nimport pytest\\n\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry import control_wiring as wiring\\n\\n\\n@pytest.fixture\\ndef restored(monkeypatch, tmp_path):\\n    for name in ('AOS_CURRENT_SIGNED_RECEIPT', 'AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE',\\n                 'AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID'):\\n        monkeypatch.delenv(name, raising=False)\\n    root = tmp_path / 'bundles'\\n    root.mkdir()\\n    trust = tmp_path / 'roots.json'\\n    trust.write_text('{}')\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_BUNDLE_ROOT', str(root))\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_BUNDLE_TRUST_ROOTS_FILE', str(trust))\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE', '/protected/restored.json')\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID', 'ab2fd72f-d81c-400d-bbbc-e1589a159d6b')\\n    return root, trust\\n\\n\\ndef call_gate(**changes):\\n    return wiring._current_a0v_host_preflight(**{\\n        'signed_receipt': '', 'credential_reference': '/protected/planes.json',\\n        'preparation_only': True, **changes})\\n\\n\\ndef test_explicit_restored_route_dispatches_exact_original_cli(monkeypatch, restored):\\n    calls = []\\n    def run(command, **kwargs):\\n        calls.append((command, kwargs))\\n        return SimpleNamespace(returncode=2, stdout='')\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(wiring.subprocess, 'run', run)\\n    assert call_gate() is False  # Failed preflight is never admitted.\\n    assert len(calls) == 1\\n    command, kwargs = calls[0]\\n    assert command[2:] == ['--credential-file', '/protected/planes.json',\\n        '--restored-api-identity', '/protected/restored.json',\\n        '--restored-installation', 'ab2fd72f-d81c-400d-bbbc-e1589a159d6b',\\n        '--bundle-root', str(restored[0]), '--trust-roots-file', str(restored[1]),\\n        '--preparation-only']\\n    assert kwargs['env']['AOS_DOTENV_DISABLED'] == '1'\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('invalid', ['full', 'mixed', 'missing-identity', 'empty-installation',\\n                                     'relative-identity', 'relative-root'])\\ndef test_invalid_explicit_restored_route_has_no_subprocess_or_legacy_fallback(monkeypatch, restored, invalid):\\n    kwargs = {}\\n    if invalid == 'full': kwargs['preparation_only'] = False\\n    if invalid == 'mixed': kwargs['signed_receipt'] = '/signed/historical.json'\\n    if invalid == 'missing-identity': monkeypatch.delenv('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE')\\n    if invalid == 'empty-installation': monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID', '')\\n    if invalid == 'relative-identity': monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE', 'relative.json')\\n    if invalid == 'relative-root': monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_BUNDLE_ROOT', 'relative')\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(wiring.subprocess, 'run', lambda *_a, **_k: pytest.fail('preflight dispatched'))\\n    assert call_gate(**kwargs) is False\\n\\n\\ndef test_original_builder_reaches_restored_preflight_without_historical_receipt(monkeypatch, restored):\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_HOST_ENABLED', '1')\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_PREPARATION_ONLY', '1')\\n    monkeypatch.setenv('AOS_EXTENSION_RUNTIME_CREDENTIAL_FILE', '/protected/planes.json')\\n    calls = []\\n    def rejected(**kwargs):\\n        calls.append(kwargs)\\n        return False\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(wiring, '_current_a0v_host_preflight', rejected)\\n    selection = wiring.build_production_runtime_host_selection(control_plane=None)\\n    assert selection.status == 'INACTIVE'\\n    assert selection.error_code == 'CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_PREFLIGHT_FAILED'\\n    assert calls == [{'signed_receipt': '', 'credential_reference': '/protected/planes.json',\\n                      'preparation_only': True}]\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('changed', ['installation', 'database', 'mode', 'authorization'])\\ndef test_restored_report_must_match_requested_installation_and_current_database(monkeypatch, restored, changed):\\n    report = {'outcome': 'CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_READONLY_PREFLIGHT_GREEN',\\n        'authorization': 'PREFLIGHT_ONLY_NO_RUNTIME_START', 'scope': ['org-org', 'dev-project'],\\n        'admissionMode': 'PREPARATION_ONLY', 'database': 'aos_meta_head',\\n        'installationId': 'ab2fd72f-d81c-400d-bbbc-e1589a159d6b',\\n        'databaseAuthority': ['172.0.0.2', 5432, 'aos_meta_head'],\\n        'signedRoot': str(restored[0]), 'trustRoots': str(restored[1])}\\n    if changed == 'installation': report['installationId'] = 'old'\\n    if changed == 'database': report['database'] = 'old'\\n    if changed == 'mode': report['admissionMode'] = 'FULL'\\n    if changed == 'authorization': report['authorization'] = 'START'\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(wiring.subprocess, 'run', lambda *_a, **_k:\\n                        SimpleNamespace(returncode=0, stdout=json.dumps(report)))\\n    import psycopg\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(psycopg, 'connect', lambda *_a, **_k: pytest.fail('untrusted report connected'))\\n    assert call_gate() is False\\n\\n\\ndef test_restored_success_keeps_original_api_authority_and_generation_pins(monkeypatch, restored):\\n    report = {'outcome': 'CURRENT_SIGNED_HOST_READONLY_PREFLIGHT_GREEN',\\n        'authorization': 'PREFLIGHT_ONLY_NO_RUNTIME_START', 'scope': ['org-org', 'dev-project'],\\n        'admissionMode': 'PREPARATION_ONLY', 'database': 'aos_meta_head',\\n        'installationId': 'ab2fd72f-d81c-400d-bbbc-e1589a159d6b',\\n        'databaseAuthority': ['172.0.0.2', 5432, 'aos_meta_head'],\\n        'signedRoot': str(restored[0]), 'trustRoots': str(restored[1]),\\n        'credentialFileGeneration': [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(wiring.subprocess, 'run', lambda *_a, **_k:\\n                        SimpleNamespace(returncode=0, stdout=json.dumps(report)))\\n    monkeypatch.setattr('aos_api.db.get_dsn', lambda: 'fixture-api-dsn')\\n    pins, roots = [], []\\n    monkeypatch.setattr('aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_connections.pin_runtime_file_generation',\\n                        lambda path, generation: pins.append((path, generation)))\\n    monkeypatch.setattr('aos_api.aip_responsibility_template_authority.pin_verified_signed_release_root',\\n                        lambda root: roots.append(root))\\n    class Conn:\\n        read_only = False\\n        database = 'aos_meta_head'\\n        def __enter__(self): return self\\n        def __exit__(self, *_): return None\\n        def execute(self, query):\\n            assert self.read_only is True\\n            assert 'SELECT' in query\\n            return self\\n        def fetchone(self):\\n            return {'server_addr': '172.0.0.2', 'server_port': 5432, 'database_name': self.database}\\n    conn = Conn()\\n    monkeypatch.setattr('psycopg.connect', lambda *_a, **_k: conn)\\n    assert call_gate() is True\\n    assert pins == [('/protected/planes.json', [1, 2, 3, 4, 5])]\\n    assert roots == [restored[0]]\\n    conn.database = 'another_database'\\n    assert call_gate() is False\\n    assert len(pins) == len(roots) == 1\\n    conn.database = 'aos_meta_head'\\n    report['databaseAuthority'][2] = 'another_database'\\n    assert call_gate() is False\\n    report['databaseAuthority'][2] = 'aos_meta_head'\\n    monkeypatch.setattr('aos_api.extension_runtime.runtime_connections.pin_runtime_file_generation',\\n                        lambda *_: (_ for _ in ()).throw(RuntimeError('file changed')))\\n    assert call_gate() is False\\n    assert len(roots) == 1\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-material-2.txt\": \"# 当前恢复库预检接入原 RuntimeHost 选择器\\n\\nRules：沿 231 原状态机及已批准恢复方案；aos-engineering-delivery 的方案→RED→最小改动→专项/相邻→复核→Delivery。唯一 m1 写者，不改用户已有正常代码、库卷或数据。本波修改目录：services/aos-api/aos_api/asset_registry/control_wiring.py、services/aos-api/tests/extension_runtime/test_qyh_restored_host_wiring.py，证据本目录。\\n\\n候选 A：已完成的只读 restored preparation adapter 接到原 builder，依赖上一 Task 108 tests 和 PASS4/4，当前代码授权已具备；实际启动仍需独立正式身份/Owner/配置/预算门。候选 B：原独立 clone Source reader 锁兼容演练，依赖该已登记 Lease 和 lab，当前库只读。选择 A，本波只做代码接线，不设置开启环境或重启服务。\\n\\n保留既有 _current_a0v_host_preflight 参数和历史 signed receipt 路径。增加两个明确 opt-in 环境字段 AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_API_IDENTITY_FILE、AOS_CURRENT_RESTORED_INSTALLATION_ID；任一字段存在即选择恢复路径，包括空值，不允许失败回退。必须两者非空，preparation_only=True、signed_receipt 为空，现有 bundle root/trust roots/三平面 credential 均绝对路径。调用上一 Task 原脚本明确恢复 CLI；报告仍经过原 outcome/authorization/scope/mode、当前 API 数据库物理 authority 和根目录、身份文件 generation pin 核验，并额外绑定恢复安装 id 和 aos_meta_head。FULL 模式及混合输入拒绝；原 Host enabled 默认行为保持不变。\\n\\nRED：精确参数派发及报告绑定，半配/空值/混合/FULL/相对路径不得启动子进程或回落；原 builder 必须在当前恢复配置下进入原 gate，Host 默认关闭仍不探测。共享既有完整后验核对，不使用假 admission predicate。专项及旧 preflight、恢复入口、UI wiring、runtime identity 相邻回归；独立冻结资料审阅。没有新 UI 改动，浏览器不适用；不会把 test 或 PASS 当八台已恢复。\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-restored-host-preflight-wiring-20261013/review-m